%% Status: target design (ARCHITECTURE.md section 4.1). Steps 5-7 of the migration.
flowchart TD
    PICK["User picks leaf / panicle / grain"] --> LIVE["Live guidance (02, 03)"]
    LIVE --> SHOT["Capture + quality check (04)"]
    SHOT -- rejected --> LIVE
    SHOT -- accepted --> GATE["Species gate (06)"]
    GATE -- "not sorghum / unsure" --> STOP["Show reason, retake"]
    GATE -- sorghum --> CARD{"Colour card found?"}
    CARD -- no --> REJ["Reject: colour card not visible"]
    CARD -- yes --> CORR["Colour correction + pixels per mm"]
    CORR --> MEAS["Measured trait readers<br/>(colours, seed size)"]
    CORR --> LEARN["Learned trait heads<br/>(same model, later)"]
    MEAS & LEARN --> EST["TraitEstimate per trait<br/>(probabilities, noise floor)"]
    EST --> ACC["Accumulate across photos"]
    ACC --> NB["Naive Bayes over cultivar tables"]
    NB --> DEC{"Best match fits well?"}
    DEC -- yes --> RES["Top matches + traits that drove them"]
    DEC -- "several share profile" --> GRP["Group of compatible cultivars"]
    DEC -- no --> UNR["Unrecognized + compatible group"]
